      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article provides an introduction to the field of palliative medicine as it applies to the care of HIV/AIDS. Issues of pain management, end-of-life care, ethics, and bereavement are discussed with the intention of providing the primary care physician additional resources in the provision of care to patients with HIV/AIDS."},
